notes={
'zh':'''原 Native 字段协调器的冷布局准备接入见 `20261023-core-cost-native-cold-field-coordinator/`。仅私有测试入口可借用同一文件／metadata／精确源 pin 的候选 ReadContext；正常调用仍读取持久化描述符并保留冷模式发布 guard。私有候选一律在首次物理写入前拒绝，不提供可选发布开关。先以 membership 的全局热 token 集分派字段；同一列的多个热更改先合并，冷更改按实际 owner 合并最终字段，保留 NULL／缺失语义并过滤热字段。只读取相关冷根，原有 canonical 编码／压缩边界决定 inline 或同批 whole-root 载体；相同 payload 跨 owner 去重。既有 largeFields holder 同时供冷根认证与原 Immutable／manifest／content-index 准备，禁止独立写入或读取未发布 manifest。membership 按值复制后释放物理 pin，再读取冷根；标准参考编码的两块临时缓冲先计费。

冷块分拆／组搬迁沿用原 prepareColdBlocks 和 GroupDirectory 脏路径。修复了原 Native 目录循环遗漏“只有 groups upsert”的外层过滤条件；否则已生成的目录更新可能被提前跳过。29 项定向测试验证兼容热更新／缺失热插入、混合冷热更新／同列多 owner 合并、NULL 插入、删除冷根／缺失删除 no-op、8193 字节新载体跨 owner 去重及原大值规划、63-owner 冷块增长触发组目录编辑；文件、源根、I/O epoch、公开 ID 不变，原账户退款。不同 pin、竞争普通 ROW 拒绝。测试入口使用公开写入相同的 16 KiB 源存储预留和 1 MiB 总额度。

测试修正保留原失败报告：只读 store 必须在 writer 之前打开；原路由夹具直接修改 Bootstrap 开启 compact flag，须先完成真实 writer admission 的外部源重同步，再测量“字段准备零写入”，不能把重同步写入误归因于准备器。候选仍为私有内存描述符，没有假称真实公开转换。实际 Catalog／索引／约束源的新模式覆盖、物理安装、全局热降级、新 owner／删除／liveness／最终组清理／逆转换、完整空间准入与公开生命周期仍未完成，P7／进度仍为 90%。未跑全量单测或性能矩阵，不提交／推送。''',
'en':'''Original Native cold-field coordinator preparation: `20261023-core-cost-native-cold-field-coordinator/`. Only laboratory access can borrow a candidate ReadContext with the exact file/metadata/source pin; normal callers still load durable descriptors and retain cold-mode publication guards. Candidate sources unconditionally refuse before the first physical write; there is no optional publication switch. Dispatch uses globally hot membership tokens; multiple changes to one hot column merge first. Cold changes merge final owner fields, preserve NULL/missing semantics and exclude hot fields. Only affected cold roots are read. Original canonical/compression bounds select inline roots or batch-local whole-root carriers, deduplicated across owners. The same retained largeFields holders feed cold-root proof and original Immutable/manifest/content-index preparation; no independent write or unpublished-manifest read. Copy membership by value and release its physical pin before reading cold roots; admit both standard reference-encoding buffers before construction.

Original prepareColdBlocks and GroupDirectory dirty paths handle splitting/relocation. Fix original Native directory loop filtering that omitted groups-only upserts and could skip an already prepared directory change.29 targeted cases cover compatible hot updates/missing-hot insertion, mixed hot/cold changes and same-column owner merges, NULL insertion, cold-root removal/missing-delete no-op, actual8193-byte cross-owner carrier dedup through original immutable planning, and63-owner growth producing a group-directory edit. Files/source roots/I/O epoch/public IDs stay unchanged and accounts refund; another pin/competing ordinary ROW refuse. Test access uses the public writer’s same16KiB source-store reserve within1MiB.

Original failed reports are retained: read-only stores must open before taking the writer; the routing fixture directly advances Bootstrap for its compact flag, so consume actual writer admission’s external-source rebase before measuring zero-write field preparation. Rebase I/O cannot be attributed to the preparer. This remains an in-memory candidate descriptor, not real public conversion. Real Catalog/index/constraint source coverage for this mode, physical installation, global hot demotion, new-owner/deletion/liveness/final-group cleanup/inverse, whole-space admission and public lifecycle remain open. P7/progress90%, no full suite/performance matrix/commit/push.'''}
